            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "So after a lot of back and forth I decided to go ahead and replace `ignore_lines` with a more flexible `ignore_text` and `ignore_attr`. Both of new options can be either an array of number for lines to ignore text/attr *or* a boolean indicating whether to ignore the whole part (for example, `ignore_attr = true` ignores any highlighting when comparing screenshots).\n\nThe downside is that leaving `ignore_lines` felt redundant, so it is now soft deprecated. It will work at least until the next release (but with annoying warning) and will be removed some time afterwards. @ibhagwan, if anybody will complain about that, I'll tell them that it's your fault :)",
