            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "> hmm, tried to use it today, but it looks like the change is just about ignoring the attrs, it doesn't also remove them when creating the screenshot or when reporting Observed/Stored. I think I'll stick to what I have for now.\n\nYes, of course. Create/get screenshot and compare to reference screenshot are two different operations. The screenshot format is fixed (at least until there is a good way to get exact cell *colors* to store as \"attribute map legend\" of sorts) and includes both text and attribute parts. How the reference screenshot gets compared to the target one is subject of configuration here.",
